      "content": "but like, i feel like i can totally handle it if i just stay home and monitor myself. if i take the benadryl and maybe some ibuprofen too, won't that cover everything? if the tightness gets worse i'll call someone, i just dont want to deal with the ER if i don't have to. can't i just wait an hour and see if the pills work first?",
